                                      "remark":  "概述页占位：眉标、标题、正文、四宫格卡片、底部注释。样式与脚本内嵌。",
                                      "html":  "<style>\n  .ov {\n    padding: 26px 28px 74px;\n    animation: ovIn 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.28, 1) both;\n  }\n  @keyframes ovIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  }\n  .ov-eye {\n    font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Consolas, monospace;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .ov-title {\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  }\n  .ov-lead {\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    padding-bottom: 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    max-width: 590px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32);\n  }\n  .ov-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 11px;\n  }\n  .ov-card {\n    min-height: 86px;\n    padding: 13px 15px 14px;\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 9px;\n  }\n  .ov-card span {\n    font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Consolas, monospace;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\n  }\n  .ov-line {\n    height: 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n  }\n  .ov-line.short {\n    width: 58%;\n  }\n  .ov-foot {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    padding-top: 13px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ov\">\n  <div class=\"ov-eye\">眉标位</div>\n  <h1 class=\"ov-title\">标题位</h1>\n  <p class=\"ov-lead\">正文位 · 留给你的文案</p>\n\n  <div class=\"ov-grid\">\n    <div class=\"ov-card\">\n      <span>区块 01</span>\n      <div class=\"ov-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ov-line short\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ov-card\">\n      <span>区块 02</span>\n      <div class=\"ov-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ov-line short\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ov-card\">\n      <span>区块 03</span>\n      <div class=\"ov-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ov-line short\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ov-card\">\n      <span>区块 04</span>\n      <div class=\"ov-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ov-line short\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ov-foot\">底部注释位</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>/* 概览页内联脚本：可直接使用 window、document、iframe 内的 DOM */</script>"
