                                      "remark":  "指令与排版页占位：分节、标题、两个内容区块、底部注释。样式与脚本内嵌。",
                                      "html":  "<style>\n  .sy {\n    padding: 24px 28px 68px;\n    animation: syIn 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.28, 1) both;\n  }\n  @keyframes syIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  }\n  .sy-eye {\n    font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Consolas, monospace;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\n    margin-bottom: 9px;\n  }\n  .sy-title {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  }\n  .sy-cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .sy-block {\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .sy-block > h4 {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Consolas, monospace;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  }\n  .sy-slot {\n    min-height: 176px;\n    padding: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .sy-foot {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding-top: 12px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);\n    margin-right: 148px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sy\">\n  <div class=\"sy-eye\">分节位</div>\n  <h1 class=\"sy-title\">标题位</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"sy-cols\">\n    <div class=\"sy-block\">\n      <h4>区块 01</h4>\n      <div class=\"sy-slot\">内容位</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sy-block\">\n      <h4>区块 02</h4>\n      <div class=\"sy-slot\">内容位</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sy-foot\">底部注释位</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>/* 指令与排版页内联脚本占位 */</script>"
